  "descriptionEn": "Base 1, height 0.15. Illustrates thin-domain asymptotics: the first eigenfunction concentrates along the ridge; the spectrum is governed by a 1D Schrödinger operator with potential 1/h(x)² (Friedlander–Solomyak 2009; Freitas–Krejčiřík 2008).",
